  "worked_solution": "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each componentt separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\u27e8\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{cos}\u2061t,\\,{sec}^{2}\u2061t\u27e9\\text{d}t & =\u27e8{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{cos}\u2061t\\,\\text{d}t,{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}{sec}^{2}\u2061t\\,\\text{d}t\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{sin}\u2061t\\,\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /4},\\,\\operatorname{tan}\u2061t\\,\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /4}\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8\\text{\u00a0}\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(\\pi /4)-\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(0),\\,\\operatorname{tan}\u2061(\\pi /4)-\\operatorname{tan}\u2061(0)\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8\\text{\u00a0}\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}-0,\\,1-0\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e81,\\,1\u27e9\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
